WalletKitFFI statically links libusb 1.0.27 (https://libusb.info), licensed
under the GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 (see libusb-COPYING).

libusb is built, unmodified, from the sources bundled in the libusb1-sys 0.7.0
crate (https://crates.io/crates/libusb1-sys), and only into the macOS slice.
The corresponding source is attached to each WalletKit release as
libusb-1.0.27-source.tar.gz; upstream it is
https://github.com/libusb/libusb/releases/tag/v1.0.27.

WalletKit is open source: https://github.com/ReefrWallet/WalletKit. To relink
it with a modified libusb, see "Replacing libusb" in its README.
